-align:left"><b><span class="emphasis">Who We Are</span></b></p><p>At Kyndryl, we run and reimagine the mission-critical technology systems that drive advantage for the worldâ€™s leading businesses.&nbsp; We are at the heart of progress; with proven expertise and a continuous flow of AI-powered insight, enabling smarter decisions, faster innovation, and a lasting competitive edge. For our peopleâ€”Kyndrylsâ€”that means doing purposeful work that powers human progress. Join us and experience a flexible, supportive environment where your well-being is prioritized and your potential can thrive.</p><p style="text-align:inherit"></p><p style="text-align:left"><b><span class="emphasis">The Role</span></b></p><p>Your role<br>Step into the engine room of enterprise technology, where every decision you make can shape how a customerâ€™s systems perform today - and scale for tomorrow. Youâ€™ll dive deep into complex infrastructure environments, solving challenging technical problems, designing seamless integrations and ensuring systems run reliably at every level. Your expertise across networks, endpoints and mainframes, paired with a knack for logical problem-solving and clear documentation, will guide projects from concept to execution. Your solutions will make a real impact that customers notice and remember.<br><br>In this role, youâ€™ll balance hands-on delivery with long-term strategic planning. From analyzing issues and testing solutions to automating processes and integrating across platforms, your work will touch every layer of IT infrastructure. Youâ€™ll collaborate with Architects, Technicians and Project Managers, gaining broad exposure and continuous opportunities to grow your skills and influence.<br><br>What you will do<br>Analyze and Solve<br>â€¢Diagnose complex issues across servers, networks, cloud environments and systems to identify root causes<br>â€¢Recommend solutions that balance technical feasibility, timelines and customer priorities<br>â€¢Test, refine and automate processes to improve reliability, efficiency and repeatability<br>â€¢Assess risks proactively and implement strategies to prevent disruptions<br><br>Design and Integrate<br>â€¢Plan end-to-end infrastructure solutions across platforms and technologies<br>â€¢Integrate systems in hybrid cloud and on-prem environments to ensure seamless operation<br>â€¢Automate workflows and processes to streamline delivery and reduce errors<br>â€¢Document architectures and procedures for hand-offs, knowledge sharing and operational continuity<br><br>Collaborate and Deliver<br>â€¢Coordinate cross-functional teams including Architects, Project Managers and Technicians<br>â€¢Drive project delivery from initiation to completion with attention to quality and timelines<br>â€¢Communicate technical solutions clearly to customers and stakeholders<br>â€¢Build customer confidence by delivering tangible, high-impact results<br><br>Grow and Advance<br>â€¢Expand technical expertise across cloud platforms, enterprise IT systems and emerging technologies<br>â€¢Earn certifications and qualifications while applying them on real projects<br>â€¢Pursue career paths toward Architect or Distinguished Engineer roles</p><p style="text-align:inherit"></p><p style="text-align:left"><b><span class="emphasis">Who You Are</span></b></p><p>Required skills and experience<br><br>â€¢Deep expertise within specific technology domain areas (e.g., software development, cloud computing, systems engineering, infrastructure, security, networking, data &amp; analytics)<br>â€¢Enterprise IT application experience<br>â€¢Hands-on experience in at least one of the following: software development, DevOps engineering, systems administration, or systems architecture in public cloud AWS domain<br>â€¢In-depth knowledge of Windows and Linux Operating System<br><br>Preferred skills and experience<br><br>â€¢Familiar with a variety of IT concepts, practices, and procedures<br>â€¢Knowledge of design techniques, tools, and principals involved in production of precision technical plans, blueprints, drawings, and models<br>â€¢Logic and reasoning to identify the strengths and weaknesses of alternative solutions, conclusions, or approaches to problems<br>â€¢Analytical and problem-solving skills with high attention to detail</p><p style="text-align:inherit"></p><p style="text-align:left"><b><span class="emphasis">Being You</span></b></p><p>The â€œKynâ€ in Kyndryl means kinship, which represents the strong bonds we have with each other, our customers and our communities. We focus on ensuring all Kyndryls feel included and we welcome people of all cultures, backgrounds, and experiences. Even if you donâ€™t meet every requirement, we encourage you to apply. We believe in growth, and weâ€™re excited to see what you can bring. At Kyndryl, employee feedback has told us that our number one driver of employee engagement is belonging. That sense of belonging â€” being a valued, respected, trusted member of the team â€” is fundamental to our culture and fueling great experiences for our customers. This dedication to welcoming everyone into our company means that Kyndryl gives you the ability to thrive and contribute to our culture of empathy and shared success. Thatâ€™s The Kyndryl Way.</p><p></p><p><span class="emphasis"><b>What You Can Expect</b></span></p><p><br>Your career with us isnâ€™t just a jobâ€”itâ€™s an adventure with purpose.&nbsp; We offer a dynamic, hybrid-friendly culture that supports your well-being and empowers you to grow. Our Be Well programs are thoughtfully designed to support your financial, mental, physical, and social healthâ€”because we know that when you feel your best, you do your best. <br><br>From your very first day, youâ€™ll dive into impactful work that powers the systems our customers rely on every day. You wonâ€™t just contributeâ€”youâ€™ll make a difference, tackling meaningful projects that sharpen your skills and fuel your growth.<br><br>Weâ€™re here to champion your journey. With powerful tools to chart your career path, personalized development goals aligned with your ambitions, and continuous feedback to keep you inspired and on track, youâ€™ll have everything you need to thrive and evolve. Youâ€™ll develop in-demand skills to grow your career and achieve your ambitions with access to cutting-edge learning opportunitiesâ€”from certifications with Microsoft, Google, and Amazon to coaching and hands-on experiences. And through it all, youâ€™ll be part of a culture that values empathy, restless learning, and a devotion to shared success. <br><br>We want you to thrive hereâ€”and weâ€™re committed to helping you do just that. Ready to make an impact? Join us and help shape whatâ€™s next.</p><p></p><p><span class="emphasis"><b>Get Referred!</b></span><br><span>If you know someone that works at Kyndryl, when asked â€˜How Did You Hear About Usâ€™ during the application process, select â€˜Employee Referralâ€™ and enter your contact's Kyndryl email address.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="css-4wg8k6"></div><div data-automation-id="jobSidebar" class="css-9bbna8"><div data-automation-id="sidebar" class="css-1gw0f0n"><div data-automation-id="textSection" class="css-6qub7p"><h3 id="38" class="css-1uppmgb">Welcome!&nbsp;</h3><div dir="ltr"><div class="css-vr2o4s"><div id="40" class="css-cx1qpg" tabindex="-1"><div data-automation-id="richText" class="css-1hydfaj"><p style="text-align:left">Weâ€™re glad youâ€™re here.<span>&nbsp; </span>Take a look around at the many exciting career opportunities we have available and apply today!<br><br>Canâ€™t find a suitable job opening?<br><br><span class="emphasis"><b>Drop off your CV/Resume</b></span><br><a href="https://kyndryl.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/en-US/KyndrylEarlyCareers/introduceYourself" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Drop off your CV/Resume</a> and a Recruiter will reach out with related career information that match your experience and expertise.<br><br><span class="emphasis"><b>Sign up for Job Alerts</b></span><br>Create your account and then <a href="https://kyndryl.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/en-US/KyndrylEarlyCareers/jobAlerts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">sign up for job alerts</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;When new jobs become available that meet your criteria, youâ€™ll be alerted right away!</p></div></div><div class="css-tfj2rs"><button type="button" data-automation-id="showLess" id="39" aria-controls="40" aria-describedby="38" class="css-1wytscr"><span class="css-pplshs">Read Less</span><span class="css-1p727v3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" class="wd-icon-chevron-up-small wd-icon" focusable="false" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><g fill-rule="evenodd" class="wd-icon-container"><path d="M12 10.294 7.39 14.87a.44.44 0 0 1-.62 0l-.64-.635a.44.44 0 0 1 0-.624l5.523-5.482A.44.44 0 0 1 12 8a.44.44 0 0 1 .347.127l5.523 5.482.002.002a.44.44 0 0 1-.002.622l-.64.635a.44.44 0 0 1-.62 0z" class="wd-icon-fill"></path></g></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="css-1hnm6b6"><div data-automation-id="videoSection" class="css-6qub7p"><h3 id="41" class="css-1uppmgb">Drive progress with purpose</h3><div data-automation-id="videoPlayer" class="css-8atqhb"><div style=""><div id="muse-vw221431oz" class="muse-widget"><div class="css-1t1zqa7"><div class="css-w7qymy"><div class="js-fullscreen-element css-13wylk3" data-automation-id="muse-container"><div class="js-container css-4bfoht"><div class="js-content css-cqup3"><img role="presentation" data-muse-selector="background-poster" src="https://wd5-media.myworkdaycdn.com/m/v3/fetch/kyndryl/14Gb/c/C08A5DDD28C9BE93/H4ON1vJqfiIf4R2A9J8wBs4WKomO9VfK/nb8Gmz/progressive.h264.1080p.v7.mp4.0000001.jpg?__token__=ver=2023.09~kid=mediatransit~exp=1782335244~origin=wd5.myworkday.com~ttl=14400~hmac=b4d919472e725850a3839ddeba696566046d046499839058a2552490d0dec8e3" class="css-w5pegr"><div><div class="css-ybufr"><div class="css-uizuee"><div class="css-y4123